SEF School Operator Management System
A multi-school operator control center designed for rural Sindh field operations with offline-first local persistence and automatic cloud synchronization.
Key Capabilities & Architecture
Role-Based Onboarding & Access Control:
Operator Sign-Up & Login: Full central control across all partner schools, employee salaries, and global settings.
Staff Credential Generator: Operators can generate username IDs and security PINs for Head Teachers and Supervisors.
Head Teacher Login: Strictly restricted to their assigned school campus only.
Supervisor Login: Read-only oversight across all official reports, monitoring visits, and student performance.
1-Tap Demo Presets: Instant switching between Operator, Head Teacher (Dua Public School, Dadu), and SEF Supervisor for rapid field evaluation.
Offline-First Storage & Synchronization:
Operates without internet; changes are queued and stored in encrypted local storage.
Live status indicators (✓ Synced, ⟳ Syncing..., ⚠ N Pending, ✕ Offline) with auto-sync on network reconnection and manual "Sync Now" triggers.
Field offline simulator mode to test poor connectivity environments in desert/remote areas.
Full Device Backup & Restore: One-tap JSON export to phone storage and restore with integrity pre-check.
Centralized Multi-School Hierarchy:
Controls 6 preloaded Sindh schools (Dadu, Badin, Tharparkar, Khairpur, Larkana, Sukkur).
Scope Switcher ([ All Schools ▼ ] vs specific school) with persistent district, school code, academic year, and date indicators.
Complete 11-tab School Profile (Overview, Students, Teachers, Attendance, Results, Visits, Facilities, Issues, Tasks, Payroll, History).
Student & Staff Identification Profiles:
Support for Profile Photo, NADRA Form-B document scans, and Parent CNIC photos for students.
Support for CNIC front/back scans and profile pictures for Head Teachers, Teachers, and Peons.
Batch student promotion and inter-school transfer workflows.
Detailed Salary & Payroll Management System:
Monthly payroll generator for all employees (Head Teachers, Senior/Junior Teachers, Peons/Ayas).
Configurable base salaries, hardship/travel allowances, and automated attendance-based salary deductions for unexcused absences.
Printable official Salary Payslips with SRESO/SEF partner branding and signature blocks.
Daily Attendance & Teacher Monitoring:
Class-wise student roll calls (Present, Absent, Leave) with automated percentage calculations.
Operator Attendance Overview with automated color bands (Green 
90%, Yellow 80–89%, Red 
80% Critical, Grey Missing).
Teacher attendance tracking with unexcused absenteeism alerts.
Examinations & Official Gazette Generator:
Midterm, Annual, Monthly tests with automated total, percentage, pass/fail, and student ranking (1st, 2nd, 3rd).
Official Gazette result sheet generator with CSV and print export.
School Visits & 17-Point Quality Checklist:
Arrival/departure logs, GPS coordinate capture, classroom pedagogy ratings, and photographic evidence.
17-point quality checklist covering administration, cleanliness, solar power, water, and boundary walls.
Reports Center (14 Reports):
Covers School Profiles, Student Enrollment, Teacher Salaries, Daily/Monthly Attendance, Examination Gazette, Pass/Fail, School Comparisons, Monitoring, Issues, Tasks, and Operator Executive Summaries with CSV/print exports.
PWA Ready:
Service worker caching, Web App Manifest, offline banner, and in-app home screen install button with iOS Safari support.
